{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>Evil in the eyes of YHWH.</b> Like the evil of Onan — destroying his seed, for it says of Onan ״וַיָּמֶת גַּם אֹתוֹ״; the death of Er is like the death of Onan. And why was Er destroying his seed? So that she would not conceive and lose her beauty."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 38, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:02:34.535683070Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}